{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-revision-convergence.md","title":"有限经典修正无固定点和有限周期","display":"thm-revision-convergence — 有限经典修正无固定点和有限周期","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-revision-convergence","aliases":["91-thm-revision-convergence","91-thm-revision-stability","91-thm-Gupta-convergence"],"display":"thm-revision-convergence — 有限经典修正无固定点和有限周期","depends_on":["[[91-df-revision-theory]]","[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-teller]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-revision-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-revision-convergence</span><span>91-thm-revision-stability</span><span>91-thm-Gupta-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-revision-convergence — 有限经典修正无固定点和有限周期"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" href=\"?note=7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" title=\"91-df-revision-theory\">91-df-revision-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为原书标准经典修正，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\">\\(\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span> 为直接闭项自指句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n(\\varphi)\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b_n(\\varphi)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span> 是否属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^n(A)\">\\(\\Gamma^n(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Gamma^n(A)\\ne A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Gamma^n(A)\\ne A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_{k+1}(\\lambda)=1-b_k(\\lambda),\\qquad b_{k+1}(\\tau)=b_k(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_{k+1}(\\lambda)=1-b_k(\\lambda),\\qquad b_{k+1}(\\tau)=b_k(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二行由直接语法与闭项标准值展开一步经典满足即可。第一行不能仅由普通说谎者推出，因为它本身有二周期；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次真理的反身否定句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span>，使其编码属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^n(A)\">\\(\\Gamma^n(A)\\)</span> 当且仅当不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，因此两集合不同（Lemma 14.9）。\n若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^i(A)=\\Gamma^j(A)\">\\(\\Gamma^i(A)=\\Gamma^j(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;j\">\\(i&lt;j\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\Gamma^i(A)\">\\(B=\\Gamma^i(A)\\)</span> 就有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{j-i}(B)=B\">\\(\\Gamma^{j-i}(B)=B\\)</span>，与第一行矛盾，故所有有限阶段外延两两不同。句子的逐点最终稳定与整个外延收敛不同；真理陈述者可在各初值上恒值却不跨初值同值。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 14.9，印刷页 150–151，PDF 页 161–162。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-revision-theory","status":"resolved","id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-revision-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"b_n(\\varphi)\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^n(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Gamma^n(A)\\ne A.","display":true},{"tex":"b_{k+1}(\\lambda)=1-b_k(\\lambda),\\qquad b_{k+1}(\\tau)=b_k(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^n(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^i(A)=\\Gamma^j(A)","display":false},{"tex":"i<j","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\Gamma^i(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{j-i}(B)=B","display":false}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exc